      ⍝ Horse race, written in pure APL\360 (target program; see docs/parity.md).
      ⍝ Names live in a character matrix, output mixes text and numbers with
      ⍝ semicolons, branching uses the →LABEL×⍳COND idiom. No ⍕, ⊃, ⎕DL.
